message: >-
  Please cite this archive as a whole with this metadata, and cite the
  specific manuscript, author, release, and primary evidence for each
  individual mathematical claim.
title: "NIGHTFALL / PHASESHIFT — Independent Research Archive"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Wright
    given-names: Devin J.
date-released: 2026-10-28
repository-code: "https://github.com/d3lefts/d3lefts"
url: "https://d3lefts.github.io/d3lefts/"
abstract: >-
  A public research archive of mathematical constructions, exact finite
  certificates, source-conditional deductions, reproducibility tools,
  research manuscripts, and AI-systems experiments. Claim-level validation
  status and external source dependencies are recorded separately.
keywords:
  - reproducible mathematics
  - mathematical research
  - exact arithmetic
  - quantum information
  - independent verification
  - AI safety
